# Information Literacy: Requirements of the 21st Century Workplace.

**Authors:** Beam, Walter R.

## Abstract
Discusses business and technology trends that affect the need for employees to have more information skills. Highlights include the globalization of commerce; competition; lower-cost digital technology; employment trends; the role of digital systems; the impact of technology; advanced information-related literacy skills; and future education technology. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ637551

